  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "衛星科技與永續發展",
    "sub_ename": "SATELLITE TECHNOLOGY AND SUSTAINABLE DEVELOPMENT",
    "describe_ch": "衛星科技已深遠影響人類生活的各個層面，科技的快速發展、人口的迅速澎脹、環境的持續惡化已挑戰人類永續發展的極限，本課程以大地資訊學的整合應用學理為基礎，介紹遙感探測、全球定位系統及地理資訊系統等在生活上之實際應用，引導學生對環境的保護的覺醒，對科技發展倫理的尊重，同時探索科技新知提升資訊素養。",
    "describe_eh": "Satellite technology has influenced deeply to our daily life in all levels. Rapid development of science and population expansion plus the challenge of environment degradation etc. have threatened the sustainable of human evolution. The lecture is based on the theory of Geoinformatics technology. It introduces the basis of integrated daily applications of Remote Sensing (RS), Global Positioning system (GPS) and Geographic Information Systems(GIS) technologies. Leading students to respect ethics of scientific development and explore science of the state of the art, cognition the crisis of our treasure environments.",
